OL,3,GNEWSAStates to debate social security
OL,4,Acontributions cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States is to debate cutting 2027
OL,7,Fsocial security contributions by 0.5%.
OL,9,FDeputies Gavin St Pier and Tom Rylatt,
OL,10,Ffrom Forward Guernsey, said they would
OL,11,Fbe bringing an amendment to the Social
OL,12,FInsurance (Rates of Contributions and
OL,13,FBenefits etc.) Ordinance, 2026.
OL,15,FThe States of Deliberation will decide
OL,16,Fnext week whether to temporarily cut
OL,17,F2027 employee (primary Class 1) and
OL,18,Fself-employed (Class 2) contributions
OL,19,Fby 0.5%, to 7.1% and 12.1%.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
