OL,3,GNEWSAStates to debate social security
OL,4,Acontributions cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Pier said global events including
OL,7,Fthe Russia-Ukraine and US-Iran wars had
OL,8,Fhad knock-on effects on the island's
OL,9,Feconomy and "created significant
OL,10,Fpressures for the whole community".
